WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.000
In the previous verses of the tenth chapter,

2
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.166
Lord Krishna described His vibhutis

3
00:00:35.166 --> 00:00:37.125
in detail.

4
00:00:37.125 --> 00:00:38.500
Now in this final verse,

5
00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:41.583
giving Arjun a simple and direct truth,

6
00:00:41.583 --> 00:00:45.041
He explains the essence of His limitless power.

7
00:00:49.833 --> 00:00:51.208
Lord Krishna,

8
00:00:51.208 --> 00:00:53.833
at the close of this chapter, before Arjun

9
00:00:53.833 --> 00:00:55.000
reveals a profound

10
00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:58.541
yet simple and direct truth.

11
00:00:58.541 --> 00:01:01.125
He says, 'O Arjun,

12
00:01:01.125 --> 00:01:02.500
what is the need

13
00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:04.708
to know all these detailed accounts

14
00:01:04.708 --> 00:01:07.041
of My glory?

15
00:01:07.041 --> 00:01:08.875
Understand just this one thing –

16
00:01:08.875 --> 00:01:12.083
that with just a single part of Myself

17
00:01:12.083 --> 00:01:13.166
I not only

18
00:01:13.166 --> 00:01:14.750
sustain the entire universe,

19
00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:17.958
but also expand it.'

20
00:01:17.958 --> 00:01:20.541
In this statement, Lord Krishna, moving away

21
00:01:20.541 --> 00:01:22.833
from the description of His forms

22
00:01:22.833 --> 00:01:24.791
or vibhutis,

23
00:01:24.791 --> 00:01:27.625
emphasises that attention be focused

24
00:01:27.625 --> 00:01:30.208
on His own essential presence.

25
00:01:30.208 --> 00:01:32.750
All the examples given earlier, whether

26
00:01:32.750 --> 00:01:34.375
it is the radiance of the sun,

27
00:01:34.375 --> 00:01:37.625
the pride of the lion, or the beauty of spring,

28
00:01:37.625 --> 00:01:39.541
all are only small

29
00:01:39.541 --> 00:01:42.291
reflections of His infinite power.

30
00:01:42.291 --> 00:01:43.708
He makes clear

31
00:01:43.708 --> 00:01:45.000
that the entire universe,

32
00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:46.750
with its countless galaxies,

33
00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:49.958
stars, and living beings, exists through only

34
00:01:49.958 --> 00:01:53.291
a fraction of His power.

35
00:01:53.291 --> 00:01:54.291
Imagine

36
00:01:54.291 --> 00:01:58.458
that a single ray of sunlight
illuminates an entire room.

37
00:01:58.458 --> 00:02:01.500
That ray is a tiny part of the sun,

38
00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:04.500
yet it has the power to give light.

39
00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:05.541
In the same way,

40
00:02:05.541 --> 00:02:08.333
Lord Krishna's presence as Paramatma

41
00:02:08.333 --> 00:02:10.791
and His expansion, which dwells in every being

42
00:02:10.791 --> 00:02:13.000
and object,

43
00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:15.833
is what both protects and governs

44
00:02:15.833 --> 00:02:20.458
the entire material and spiritual world.

45
00:02:20.458 --> 00:02:21.333
This understanding

46
00:02:21.333 --> 00:02:24.750
reveals Lord Krishna's infinite nature.

47
00:02:24.750 --> 00:02:26.833
He is not only the creator,

48
00:02:26.833 --> 00:02:30.625
but also the sustainer of all existence.

49
00:02:30.625 --> 00:02:33.208
Whether it is the vastness of the universe

50
00:02:33.208 --> 00:02:35.541
or the smallest particle of life,

51
00:02:35.541 --> 00:02:38.625
everything is driven by His power.

52
00:02:38.625 --> 00:02:41.041
Through this verse, Lord Krishna reminds us

53
00:02:41.041 --> 00:02:42.666
of the immense power

54
00:02:42.666 --> 00:02:45.208
embedded in the universe.

55
00:02:45.208 --> 00:02:47.125
He invites us to centre ourselves

56
00:02:47.125 --> 00:02:51.500
on Him, who is the foundation of everything.

57
00:02:56.250 --> 00:02:59.250
You scored well in an exam.

58
00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:01.166
You got a new job.

59
00:03:01.166 --> 00:03:03.208
You bought a home.

60
00:03:03.208 --> 00:03:07.583
A feeling of pride rises within, doesn't it?

61
00:03:07.583 --> 00:03:09.041
That is natural.

62
00:03:09.041 --> 00:03:11.458
But

63
00:03:11.458 --> 00:03:16.583
when you look up at the night sky,

64
00:03:16.583 --> 00:03:21.291
countless stars, the moon, the sun,

65
00:03:21.291 --> 00:03:24.750
how does it feel?

66
00:03:24.750 --> 00:03:30.250
Does it not seem that
your achievement is so small

67
00:03:30.250 --> 00:03:34.083
before this vast creation?

68
00:03:34.083 --> 00:03:37.541
And when you come to know

69
00:03:37.541 --> 00:03:41.541
that the entire universe

70
00:03:41.541 --> 00:03:42.833
is governed by

71
00:03:42.833 --> 00:03:47.125
just a fraction of My power,

72
00:03:47.125 --> 00:03:51.250
then the mind becomes even more humble.

73
00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:58.791
But My purpose is not to make you feel inferior.

74
00:03:58.791 --> 00:04:00.750
I want to give you a perspective

75
00:04:00.750 --> 00:04:05.458
filled with hope.

76
00:04:05.458 --> 00:04:07.875
Whenever a crisis comes,

77
00:04:07.875 --> 00:04:10.666
what should you do?

78
00:04:10.666 --> 00:04:13.083
When someone loses their job,

79
00:04:13.083 --> 00:04:14.416
relationships break,

80
00:04:14.416 --> 00:04:18.291
a health problem arises,

81
00:04:18.291 --> 00:04:20.208
then remember

82
00:04:20.208 --> 00:04:24.208
no difficulty is so great

83
00:04:24.208 --> 00:04:28.625
that My power cannot overcome it.

84
00:04:28.625 --> 00:04:32.750
And when success comes, what should you do?

85
00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:36.208
Then do not let ego arise at all.

86
00:04:36.208 --> 00:04:39.291
Stay connected with Me.

87
00:04:39.291 --> 00:04:42.416
Humility in victory.

88
00:04:42.416 --> 00:04:45.166
Steadiness in challenges.

89
00:04:45.166 --> 00:04:46.708
The balance of life.

90
00:04:46.708 --> 00:04:49.750
This is it.

91
00:04:49.750 --> 00:04:51.208
Harmony.

92
00:04:55.958 --> 00:04:58.916
As parents, have you seen these worries?

93
00:04:58.916 --> 00:05:01.708
The children's education,

94
00:05:01.708 --> 00:05:05.250
household expenses, the
expectations of relatives.

95
00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:08.916
Sometimes it feels as if the
weight of the whole world

96
00:05:08.916 --> 00:05:11.041
rests on your shoulders.

97
00:05:11.041 --> 00:05:13.375
But listen,

98
00:05:13.375 --> 00:05:14.750
I

99
00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:18.833
sustain this infinite universe, crores of suns,

100
00:05:18.833 --> 00:05:22.708
countless living beings, with just

101
00:05:22.708 --> 00:05:25.416
a fraction of My power.

102
00:05:25.416 --> 00:05:29.125
Is your small family

103
00:05:29.125 --> 00:05:32.958
beyond My capacity?

104
00:05:32.958 --> 00:05:35.750
When money is short,

105
00:05:35.750 --> 00:05:39.708
when there is conflict in the family,
when worry about the future

106
00:05:39.708 --> 00:05:43.625
troubles you, then simply,

107
00:05:43.625 --> 00:05:45.708
remember Me.

108
00:05:45.708 --> 00:05:49.583
Know this, every breath in your home,

109
00:05:49.583 --> 00:05:53.000
every heartbeat, every smile

110
00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:55.500
is under My care.

111
00:05:55.500 --> 00:06:00.083
Trust that you are not alone.

112
00:06:00.083 --> 00:06:01.333
The Paramatma

113
00:06:01.333 --> 00:06:04.875
who sustains the entire world,

114
00:06:04.875 --> 00:06:07.541
how could He not care

115
00:06:07.541 --> 00:06:11.166
for your home and family?

116
00:06:11.166 --> 00:06:14.333
Leave all your worries with Me.

117
00:06:14.333 --> 00:06:18.208
You simply do your duty

118
00:06:18.208 --> 00:06:20.166
and live with dharma.

119
00:06:24.958 --> 00:06:27.666
In professional life, many times

120
00:06:27.666 --> 00:06:32.833
too much detail can overwhelm people.

121
00:06:32.833 --> 00:06:34.958
As a leader,

122
00:06:34.958 --> 00:06:37.958
it is essential to simplify complex ideas

123
00:06:37.958 --> 00:06:42.541
so that your team members remain engaged

124
00:06:42.541 --> 00:06:45.625
and can work with focus.

125
00:06:45.625 --> 00:06:47.875
When I explained to Arjun

126
00:06:47.875 --> 00:06:50.875
about My vibhutis,

127
00:06:50.875 --> 00:06:54.333
I gave many examples, but at the end

128
00:06:54.333 --> 00:06:58.333
I simplified something for him,

129
00:06:58.333 --> 00:07:01.916
saying that the entire universe

130
00:07:01.916 --> 00:07:06.541
runs on just a fraction of My energy.

131
00:07:06.541 --> 00:07:10.083
This I did not say to overwhelm him,

132
00:07:10.083 --> 00:07:12.500
but to give him clear vision

133
00:07:12.500 --> 00:07:16.416
and confidence.

134
00:07:16.416 --> 00:07:18.000
In the same way,

135
00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:20.708
as a leader, your role

136
00:07:20.708 --> 00:07:22.000
is to make complex tasks

137
00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:26.125
or strategies clear and simple.

138
00:07:26.125 --> 00:07:29.708
When people clearly understand

139
00:07:29.708 --> 00:07:31.666
'What do I need to do?'

140
00:07:31.666 --> 00:07:35.166
'What is the core purpose of my work?'

141
00:07:35.166 --> 00:07:39.583
then instead of getting lost
in unnecessary complexity,

142
00:07:39.583 --> 00:07:42.291
with focus and confidence

143
00:07:42.291 --> 00:07:44.291
they do their work.

144
00:07:44.291 --> 00:07:46.250
For example,

145
00:07:46.250 --> 00:07:48.083
doing complex mathematics

146
00:07:48.083 --> 00:07:52.208
used to be a very difficult task before, but

147
00:07:52.208 --> 00:07:56.208
in the modern age, with calculators
and computers,

148
00:07:56.208 --> 00:08:00.666
hours of work gets done in a moment.

149
00:08:00.666 --> 00:08:04.166
In the same way, as a leader, if

150
00:08:04.166 --> 00:08:08.666
you use technology and,
through simpler methods,

151
00:08:08.666 --> 00:08:12.291
get work done, then the people in your teams

152
00:08:12.291 --> 00:08:16.208
will work faster, do more, and

153
00:08:16.208 --> 00:08:18.000
do it well.

154
00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:20.166
By simplifying things,

155
00:08:20.166 --> 00:08:23.750
you empower your team

156
00:08:23.750 --> 00:08:26.666
and reduce their stress.

157
00:08:26.666 --> 00:08:29.333
Good leadership means

158
00:08:29.333 --> 00:08:34.375
guiding others with clarity.

159
00:08:34.375 --> 00:08:37.416
Explaining to them so simply

160
00:08:37.416 --> 00:08:40.791
that all their confusion disappears.

161
00:08:40.791 --> 00:08:46.125
Simplicity and clarity together give

162
00:08:46.125 --> 00:08:48.250
success.

163
00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:49.375
Think about it.
